  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量工作台-账户管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量工作台\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取升级版巨量引擎工作台认证及关联认证主体相关信息（主体id、名称、主体及资质认证状态），可通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token，返回码和返回信息详见【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"tools.ebp_subject.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/subject/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1855089467521035\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"common.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"common.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口的返回码和返回信息需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1855089467521035\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"获取组织认证及授权主体列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bteajsan9y800\">使用场景：获取升级版巨量引擎工作台认证及关联认证主体相关信息（主体id、名称、主体及资质认证状态）</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1841601358449804%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22ELDHp%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-1a3sssocyb0g0\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-1a3sssocyb0g0\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hhmtokotdpk00\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/subject/list/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1855089467521035\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4rn12jzbw4800\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4rn12jzbw4800\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-58daxyc6eqg00\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-6njy8oo1n7c00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-6njy8oo1n7c00\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-3pws8nhgjq600\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-3pws8nhgjq600\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">enterprise_organization_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-7zyucysyv0o00\">企业版工作台组织id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">query_types</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">主体类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1wy2mh20ncsg0\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-bdw5sd89h0g00\"><code>BP_OTHER</code>：关联认证主体</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-f7yoirkzrhc00\"><code>BP_OWN</code>：认证主体</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filter_company_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5u82uv6naio000\">根据公司id筛选</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filter_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">根据主体认证状态过滤，仅<code>AVAILABLE</code>代表当前主体为可使用状态，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2ani7wyloaqs0\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-8jxdxqltww400\"><code>AVAILABLE</code>：主体可用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-efgrd1vee5400\"><code>AVAILABLE_EVER</code>：对公验证过期、资质认证过期、资质审核中或审核不通过</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-eu8gv30hfco00\"><code>UNAVALIABLE</code>：主体不可用</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filter_account_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2hf6d3hyl9q000\">关联主体id过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">pagination</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section clas